sequenceDiagram
    participant BK as Backend
    participant FCM as FCM
    participant Svc as MessagingService
    participant Router as PushRouter
    participant WM as PushSyncWorker (expedited)
    participant API as Authed API (Ch 19)
    participant SSOT as Room (Ch 3)
    participant Notif as Notifier (Ch 50)

    BK->>FCM: send data msg {type: order_update, id, acct} priority high
    FCM->>Svc: onMessageReceived (wakes in Doze, Ch 47)
    Svc->>Router: route(payload)
    Router->>Router: validate + accountMatches? (Ch 42)
    Router->>WM: enqueue expedited sync(order id)
    WM->>API: GET order/{id} (Bearer token, Ch 19)
    API-->>WM: authoritative order state
    WM->>SSOT: upsert (truth)
    SSOT-->>Notif: show order-shipped notification (if permitted, Ch 51)
